<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Marketing Campaigns & Automation</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Powerful multi-channel demand generation that connects your marketing efforts directly to sales outcomes, 
            nurturing prospects from initial awareness to revenue.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Audience Segmentation and Targeting</h2>
        <p>
            The foundation of effective marketing is precise targeting. Utilize your rich CRM data to 
            build dynamic audience segments based on industry, geographic location, historical 
            spend, or recent engagement signals. This ensures that your messaging is always 
            relevant to the recipient, significantly lifting open rates and lowering the cost 
            of customer acquisition.
        </p>
        <p>
            Campaigns can be scheduled to trigger based on specific customer milestones—such as 
            contract expiry, product anniversaries, or crossing a specific spend threshold—enabling 
            highly personalized "event-driven" marketing.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Multi-Channel Drip Sequences</h2>
        <p>
            Automate your prospect nurturing with sophisticated drip sequences. Design multi-day 
            workflows that combine email outreach with WhatsApp notifications and SMS alerts. 
            Conditional logic allows the sequence to adapt based on prospect engagement—if an 
            email was ignored, the system can follow up via WhatsApp automatically, increasing the 
            probability of a response.
        </p>
        <p>
            A drag-and-drop campaign builder allows your marketing team to visualize the entire 
            customer journey, from original lead capture through to sales appointment booking, 
            ensuring a consistent brand voice across all touchpoints.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Performance Insights and ROI</h2>
        <p>
            Move beyond "vanity metrics" like opens and clicks. Pindah CRM tracks your marketing 
            performance all the way to revenue. Attribution reports identify which campaigns 
            contributed to specific closed deals, providing an accurate calculation of 
            Campaign ROI (Return on Investment). This data allows for the scientific 
            optimization of marketing budgets, focusing spend on the channels that 
            genuinely drive business growth.
        </p>
        <p>
            A/B testing features for subject lines and message content allow you to refine your 
            messaging based on empirical performance data, ensuring your marketing machine 
            becomes more efficient with every campaign launched.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
